    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Jet-Propelled Skateboard</h2><p>A high-speed board with 3 Fuel.</p><p><strong>Board Bash:</strong> 1d8 bludgeoning.</p><p><strong>Jet Rush:</strong> Spend 1 Fuel; move up to 30 ft in a straight line and make a 1d10 bludgeoning attack at the end.</p><p><strong>Drive-By Strike:</strong> Spend 1 Fuel; move up to 20 ft and make a 1d8 bludgeoning attack at any point; does not provoke from the creature attacked.</p><p><strong>Rocket Jump:</strong> Bonus Action, spend 1 Fuel; launch up to 15 ft horizontally or vertically.</p><p><strong>Refuel:</strong> Action, restore Fuel to 3.</p><p><em>Movement is a manual rider.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
